#: settings/config/fields/wizard/general.php:124
msgid "US State Laws generally operate under an Opt-out approach including in California (CCPA/CPRA) — opt-in is only required in limited cases. This option is for site owners who prefer an opt-in banner, due to CIPA-related concerns. Choosing 'Yes' blocks statistics and marketing scripts until visitors actively consent, and applies to all US visitors — not only California. Your US legal documents update automatically to match."
msgstr "US State Laws generally operate under an Opt-out approach including in California (CCPA/CPRA) — opt-in is only required in limited cases. This option is for site owners who prefer an opt-in banner, due to CIPA-related concerns. Choosing 'Yes' blocks statistics and marketing scripts until visitors actively consent, and applies to all US visitors — not only California. Your US legal documents update automatically to match."

